---
layout: base.njk
pagination:
  data: collections.groupEssayPages
  size: 1
  alias: group
  addAllPagesToCollections: false
navView: essays
permalink: "{{ group.urls.essays }}"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "Deep Thoughts: {{ group.label }}"
---
{#- One medium's essays (2026-10-25), the essays view in the media nav. An
    essay files under the medium of its first about: subject. /essays/ stays
    every essay: it is the door the "latest deep thoughts" panel opens. -#}
<h1>Deep Thoughts <span class="h1-medium">· {{ group.label }}</span></h1>
<p class="tag-index"><a href="/essays/">every essay →</a></p>

<ul class="essay-list">
  {% for e in group.essays %}
  <li>
    {% if e.chipUrl %}<span class="sky" style="background-image:url({{ e.chipUrl }})" aria-hidden="true"></span>{% endif %}
    <a href="{{ e.url }}">{{ e.title }}</a>
    <span class="archive-note">{{ e.date | readableDate }}</span>
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
